    a (float): Coefficient of x
    b (float): Constant term on the left-hand side
    c (float): Constant term on the right-hand side

    Returns:
    float or str: Solution of the equation if exists or a string indicating the nature of the solutions.
    """
    if a == 0:
        if b == 0:
            if c == 0:
                return "Infinite solutions"
            else:
                return "No solution"
        else:
            return -c / b
    else:
        return (c - b) / a

